4. **The inbox is the one way in.** Every outside event is written down by a Worker and collected by the tab.
5. **XRPC is the backbone.** Every method is \`/xrpc/<NSID>\`. Workers address each other by method through the core; other atproto services reach the Brain through a PDS.
6. **One notebook.** Every service is a module of the Cloud Brain notebook. Modules cooperate through the plugin registry.
7. **The guard deploys and repairs.** It holds the only Cloudflare token, compares hashes, self-tests, health-checks and puts back.

Each is a decision with a rejected alternative; see Decisions and Appendix A.

