| plugin name | a service module adds | consumed by |
|---|---|---|
| \`workers\` | each Worker declaration | the Services list |
| \`inbox:SOURCE\` | a handler for entries from that source | the inbox drain |
| \`assistant-tools\` | tools for robocoop-5 | the assistant |
| \`setup\` | prose and the secrets a service needs | Add recipe |

\`plugins.get\` is a generator, so a registration lives in its own cell, never in a cell a deployed function depends on.

