- **A hidden tab computes nothing.** A tab the owner has switched away from does not answer, and this spec's own tab stopped applying edits on 2026-10-05 for that reason. The lease must expire when a tab stops answering heartbeats.
- **A cell is chased as its source, not its value.** A constant cell that computed something from the DOM or the network in the tab is recomputed on the Worker, where it may fail or differ. \`simulate\` runs the emitted text and shows it.
- **A chased function that reads a global the tab has and a Worker lacks** (\`document\`, \`localStorage\`) passes in the tab and in \`simulate\`. The self-test on the uploaded version catches it.
- **A plugin registration is tab-only.** A deployed function that depends on a cell calling \`plugins.get\` meets a generator and is refused.
- **A vendored library must be one self-contained ES module.** lopecode stores libraries gzipped; a Worker part is plain JavaScript. Store it uncompressed for this, or decompress at emit; not decided.
- **A Durable Object's memory is gone after seconds idle**, and a version override does not reach Durable Object code (both measured). The wrapper uses the object for rows only.
- **A forward that follows redirects, or re-encodes a body, breaks a recipe.** Meta's signature is over the raw bytes.
- **Meta retries a webhook for up to 36 hours** and may batch updates. Append by message id.
- **Free-form WhatsApp replies stop 24 hours after the owner's last message.** A scheduled message needs an approved template.
- **A link sent on every message is spam.** One per hour while no tab holds the lease.
- **An inbox entry can be handled twice**: a tab that dies mid-turn leaves it undone.
- **The assistant can do what the page can do.** Nothing that bounds it may depend on something the page can read, click or call.
- **The owner's tab can read every secret**, so a notebook saved to the Brain from someone else is a way to lose them. Do not add a method that fetches a notebook from a URL and serves it on this origin.
- **Any app holding the owner's atproto session can ask the PDS to call the Brain as the owner.** A service JWT proves who, not which app. The experiment needed the scope \`transition:generic\`.
- **\`did:web\` is the hostname.** A Brain that changes hostname is a different service to everyone who granted or was granted.
- **\`@atcute/client\`'s \`proxy\` option is the string \`<did>#<service-id>\`.** An object gives "no service id specified in proxy header".
- **A deployed recipe has unrestricted outbound network access.**
