| host memory | lost; SQLite and alarms survive | kept | kept | n/a |
| speed of one edit | seconds (not measured) | immediate (not measured) | immediate to load; interpreted execution, slowdown not measured | n/a |
| isolation of the new code | none: same isolate, same \`env\` | chosen by the host: bindings and outbound network are handed in | strong: the interpreter sees only what the host exposes | none |
