### Separate module files, 2026-10-04 (E2)

Fifteen unbundled files posted to /versions by curl, each part application/javascript+module and named by its path: host.js, shim.js, the eleven source files of @observablehq/runtime under rt/, m/@tom/a.js and m/@tom/b.js, where a.js imports b.js and the host runs a.js through the runtime. Code in tools/scratch/cloud-brain-experiments/e2/.

- Relative specifiers resolve against the importing part's path: the upload was accepted and, listed at 0% and reached by version override, answered "hello from separate module files" three times. That response came through an Observable import of a cell from one module file into another.
