md`### The page

\`@tomlarkworthy/cloud-brain\` is the notebook's face. Served by a Brain it reads \`/auth/session\`; opened from a file it offers Clone. Every control is an \`Inputs\` control (Tom, 2026-10-05: "stick to Inputs").

