- **Runtime→Files**: when \`writeModule\` fires, \`exportModuleJS\` returns a \`fileAttachments\` map; each entry is fetched and written to disk
- **Files→Runtime**: the poller scans the attachment subdirectory for each module, detects changed files via \`lastModified\`, reads them into blob URLs, and hot-swaps entries in the module\\'s \`FileAttachment\` resolver map

